repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenwaterHealth/openlifu-closed-loop-eeg"
abstract: >-
  A reference implementation of closed-loop low-intensity focused ultrasound (LIFU)
  driven by real-time EEG, built on the OpenLIFU platform and open hardware. The system
  computes a per-subject theta-band Z-score against a resting baseline and gates
  sonication on six explicit, safety-bounded trigger conditions while a subject performs
  a 2-back working-memory task. Produced as a two-subject feasibility study. Research use
  only; not FDA cleared or approved for clinical use.
keywords:
  - LIFU
  - focused ultrasound
  - EEG
  - closed-loop neuromodulation
  - OpenLIFU
  - open hardware
  - lab streaming layer
